      "atom_id": "atom::7daab7f2c5b81906ec8a5377",
      "source_handle": "P0298",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "对于irAEs，仅抗CTLA-4诱导的结肠炎有明确的定量保护关联证据，其他irAEs（尤其是抗PD-1相关）的证据不足或矛盾，不宜泛化。",
