      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::79c14d42539eae37ca42ccd39104efa8087b4f6d5658b688c65c57555f6d6a2b",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "paper_kind"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::8325036452f95afadca6e4172a7ea209001cb8b96612e71f68a01dbf257bf84f",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::ef87d1d6193307757b844816": {
      "atom_id": "atom::ef87d1d6193307757b844816",
      "source_handle": "P0204",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "problem_or_question"
      ],
      "value": "尽管已有研究探讨肠道细菌与ICI反应的联系，但ICI治疗HCC队列中多界（细菌、真菌）微生物组的改变及其相互作用尚不完全清楚。本研究试图填补这一知识空白，探索多界微生物群作为ICI疗效预测和预后生物标志物的潜力。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::79c14d42539eae37ca42ccd39104efa8087b4f6d5658b688c65c57555f6d6a2b",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::3f3a637af7161b854e48bdc9749afb868476f116f9d16643da174e98f7bb1ad2",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::183043c3b1c9680f25443df6": {
      "atom_id": "atom::183043c3b1c9680f25443df6",
      "source_handle": "P0204",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "research_scope"
      ],
      "value": "接受免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）治疗的晚期肝细胞癌（HCC）患者队列，涉及肠道细菌、真菌及其代谢产物的多组学分析。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::79c14d42539eae37ca42ccd39104efa8087b4f6d5658b688c65c57555f6d6a2b",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::02788b6a52fb83fee1df463cf5b99243bc11ebefede88dede894ed111f59b950",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::ed7c33dc13b8de7d574213bb": {
      "atom_id": "atom::ed7c33dc13b8de7d574213bb",
      "source_handle": "P0204",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "work_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该研究旨在阐明多界肠道微生物群在ICI治疗HCC中的特征及其与临床疗效的关系。研究前瞻性纳入了80名接受ICI治疗的晚期HCC患者，利用宏基因组学、ITS2测序和代谢组学数据，对患者的肠道细菌、真菌及代谢物进行了多组学表征。研究比较了具有持久临床获益（DCB）与非持久临床获益（NDB）患者在治疗前后的微生物多样性变化，并尝试建立基于微生物特征的预测模型。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::79c14d42539eae37ca42ccd39104efa8087b4f6d5658b688c65c57555f6d6a2b",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::12e28e20b47702cd7178a2bf7f0c92a17b73753d818a438d68cf13936728aaa7",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::8993b32c33e41104077f4650": {
      "atom_id": "atom::8993b32c33e41104077f4650",
      "source_handle": "P0204",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "planning_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该论文提供了关于肠道多界微生物群（细菌+真菌+代谢物）如何关联ICI在实体瘤（HCC）中疗效的具体实证数据。其核心价值在于不仅关注细菌，还引入了真菌和代谢物视角，并区分了疗效预测（DCB/NDB）和生存预后两个维度。这有助于综述理解微生物组干预或监测的多维复杂性，特别是真菌和代谢物在其中的潜在角色，以及不同微生物类群对疗效影响的异质性。",
      "role": "planner_interpretation",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::79c14d42539eae37ca42ccd39104efa8087b4f6d5658b688c65c57555f6d6a2b",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::74358158907c3ee5bd1d171d01877dce18bb269c68d51fe2d5f3bd2843a21abd",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::64ab749a06f23eea2ace9352": {
      "atom_id": "atom::64ab749a06f23eea2ace9352",
      "source_handle": "P0204",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "结果来自HCC特定人群，外推至其他实体瘤需谨慎；预测模型未经外部验证；仅展示了关联性，未直接证明因果机制。",
        "contribution": "提供了肠道细菌和代谢物多样性及组成与ICI疗效（DCB vs NDB）关联的具体证据，显示细菌/代谢物差异显著而真菌差异较小；同时提供了基于18种细菌的预测模型（AUC=75.63%）。",
        "facet_id": "F1"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::79c14d42539eae37ca42ccd39104efa8087b4f6d5658b688c65c57555f6d6a2b",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::d6e6d8bfc6c75ea5493713d54b608c127533f5c2b13d6ab1be7ee78989a02c2d",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::cc91f5383c52eb83cd716af5": {
      "atom_id": "atom::cc91f5383c52eb83cd716af5",
      "source_handle": "P0204",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions",
        "possible_uses"
      ],
      "value": "可用于支持“肠道微生物组调节ICI疗效”的观点，特别是强调细菌和代谢物的关键作用，以及真菌可能起次要或不同作用的角色。可作为具体案例说明微生物特征如何预测临床结局。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::79c14d42539eae37ca42ccd39104efa8087b4f6d5658b688c65c57555f6d6a2b",
          "field_path": [
