      "atom_id": "atom::017a7a20036f46812363f7ff",
      "source_handle": "P0270",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "S. salivarius的发现虽显著，但其具体免疫调节机制在本研究中仅为推测，需结合其他功能学研究谨慎引用。",
