    "atom::fdec5075cda50780958d8f2e": {
      "atom_id": "atom::fdec5075cda50780958d8f2e",
      "source_handle": "P0565",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "approach"
      ],
      "value": "遵循PRISMA 2020指南进行系统综述。单一评审员执行文献搜索、筛选、数据提取和偏倚风险评估。使用ROBINS-I工具评估观察性研究的偏倚风险。由于临床、方法和统计异质性过大，无法进行定量荟萃分析，因此采用基于效应方向和一致性的叙事综合（Narrative Synthesis）。重点分析了特定菌属/种、代谢通路、饮食因素以及纵向动态变化。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::08de776306040abe73aecd87d2fabdbd99227dd11a0c0b0866dc9fe657088a28",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "approach"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::31f74040652c3a10bffa6be1ae51e3b3753dde2c941d62f4e374dfa95a684d6c",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "approach"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::5135224af9f007a7bf2449f096ff0d60cf44063ca740ea16737edc75659482c3",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::4b7fe47de065df24431a07bc": {
      "atom_id": "atom::4b7fe47de065df24431a07bc",
      "source_handle": "P0565",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "contribution_and_limits"
      ],
      "value": {
        "contribution": "提供了截至2025年关于肠道微生物组与黑色素瘤ICI反应关联的全面定性综合，明确了SCFA产生菌的积极角色和真菌失调的消极角色，并指出了微生物组作为预测生物标志物和潜在治疗靶点的潜力。",
        "limits": "由于严重的异质性，无法提供定量效应估计。证据主要来自观察性研究，存在显著的混杂和选择偏倚。结论受限于纳入研究的规模小、单中心设计以及分析方法的不一致性。不能直接外推至其他癌症类型或不同免疫疗法组合。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::08de776306040abe73aecd87d2fabdbd99227dd11a0c0b0866dc9fe657088a28",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "contribution_and_limits",
            "0"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::31f74040652c3a10bffa6be1ae51e3b3753dde2c941d62f4e374dfa95a684d6c",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "contribution_and_limits",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::35685f0fe3c5fd4ba740022f744cf3f9194ab2c84d82b2fd411bfda2fbb685ed",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::938e71d76663e61501972ebd": {
      "atom_id": "atom::938e71d76663e61501972ebd",
      "source_handle": "P0565",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "多数队列中",
        "finding": "产短链脂肪酸（SCFA）的菌属（如Faecalibacterium prausnitzii, Akkermansia muciniphila, Bifidobacterium）丰度增加通常与治疗反应改善相关；而病原体或真菌（如Candida albicans, Malassezia restricta）富集或与失调相关的特征则与疗效降低和不良生存结局相关。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::08de776306040abe73aecd87d2fabdbd99227dd11a0c0b0866dc9fe657088a28",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "0"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::31f74040652c3a10bffa6be1ae51e3b3753dde2c941d62f4e374dfa95a684d6c",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::0cee6c511906c359a271e474527dd74805f4ef90ea8e08096042ea2f9864844e",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::2179546388fe33b2e37076a9": {
      "atom_id": "atom::2179546388fe33b2e37076a9",
      "source_handle": "P0565",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "跨队列比较时",
        "finding": "微生物组-反应关联具有高度异质性和队列依赖性。没有单一的微生物签名能一致地预测所有队列的反应。例如，F. prausnitzii在某些队列中与无反应相关，而在其他大型再分析中被识别为一致的阳性生物标志物。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::08de776306040abe73aecd87d2fabdbd99227dd11a0c0b0866dc9fe657088a28",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::31f74040652c3a10bffa6be1ae51e3b3753dde2c941d62f4e374dfa95a684d6c",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::0cee6c511906c359a271e474527dd74805f4ef90ea8e08096042ea2f9864844e",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::c7584d00f2e05f3e1c15e1d9": {
      "atom_id": "atom::c7584d00f2e05f3e1c15e1d9",
      "source_handle": "P0565",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "机制层面",
        "finding": "微生物衍生的代谢物（如SCFA、钴胺素）可能通过调节树突状细胞功能、抗原呈递和T细胞激活来影响抗肿瘤免疫。纵向数据显示，治疗期间A. muciniphila的丢失可能与早期耐药性相关。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::08de776306040abe73aecd87d2fabdbd99227dd11a0c0b0866dc9fe657088a28",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "2"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::31f74040652c3a10bffa6be1ae51e3b3753dde2c941d62f4e374dfa95a684d6c",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "2"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::0cee6c511906c359a271e474527dd74805f4ef90ea8e08096042ea2f9864844e",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::373f32f8bc3e6618a2bb78ca": {
      "atom_id": "atom::373f32f8bc3e6618a2bb78ca",
      "source_handle": "P0565",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "证据质量",
        "finding": "纳入的25项研究中，17项（68%）被评定为中度偏倚风险，8项（32%）为严重偏倚风险。主要偏倚来源包括残留混杂因素和小样本单中心设计。没有研究被评为低风险。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::08de776306040abe73aecd87d2fabdbd99227dd11a0c0b0866dc9fe657088a28",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
