        {
          "record_id": "record::31f74040652c3a10bffa6be1ae51e3b3753dde2c941d62f4e374dfa95a684d6c",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "paper_kind"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::8d077ffabcc4d4f985c9b4df5cb35b981717f1b5c4acb955757c1826ec22da4f",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::2b0db90d979da2168d366c90": {
      "atom_id": "atom::2b0db90d979da2168d366c90",
      "source_handle": "P0565",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "problem_or_question"
      ],
      "value": "尽管免疫检查点抑制剂改善了黑色素瘤患者的临床结局，但治疗反应差异巨大且缺乏可靠的预测生物标志物。本研究旨在解决：肠道微生物组的哪些特征（组成、多样性、功能）与ICI的治疗反应相关？其潜在的生物学机制是什么？当前的证据基础质量如何？",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::08de776306040abe73aecd87d2fabdbd99227dd11a0c0b0866dc9fe657088a28",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::31f74040652c3a10bffa6be1ae51e3b3753dde2c941d62f4e374dfa95a684d6c",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::e1d5b630b236aea958b8496f45af31d4ad24444bf9574265407054a90765fc26",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::15579518b50eb196b81bb83c": {
      "atom_id": "atom::15579518b50eb196b81bb83c",
      "source_handle": "P0565",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "research_scope"
      ],
      "value": "人类黑色素瘤患者，接受免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI，包括抗PD-1、抗PD-L1或抗CTLA-4）治疗。聚焦于肠道微生物组（组成、多样性、代谢功能）与治疗反应（疗效及免疫相关不良事件irAEs）之间的关联。纳入2015-2025年间发表的观察性研究和数据集二次分析，排除干预性试验和仅暴露研究。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::08de776306040abe73aecd87d2fabdbd99227dd11a0c0b0866dc9fe657088a28",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::31f74040652c3a10bffa6be1ae51e3b3753dde2c941d62f4e374dfa95a684d6c",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::fbf82220ba9b44ab7a8e0d7ebe2a52d6d7821eb4c1cfdce4e59aec1b7ce82710",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::87cdb1d49ace86cdf4fe5065": {
      "atom_id": "atom::87cdb1d49ace86cdf4fe5065",
      "source_handle": "P0565",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "work_summary"
      ],
      "value": "这是一篇系统综述，旨在评估肠道微生物组特征与黑色素瘤患者免疫检查点抑制剂治疗反应之间的关联及其潜在机制。作者通过PubMed数据库检索并筛选出25项符合条件的观察性研究，采用定性综合而非定量荟萃分析的方法，因为各研究在测序平台、分类方法、结果定义和分析流程上存在显著异质性。研究评估了微生物组成、多样性及代谢功能对治疗结局的影响，并使用了ROBINS-I工具对纳入研究的偏倚风险进行了正式评估。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::08de776306040abe73aecd87d2fabdbd99227dd11a0c0b0866dc9fe657088a28",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::31f74040652c3a10bffa6be1ae51e3b3753dde2c941d62f4e374dfa95a684d6c",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::8b4cc3c99c58e1a22b504bfd0f01b2f8ff4633d06d818f9ab1a21602ed5fe32d",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::15a78806db3bf6146e66cf60": {
      "atom_id": "atom::15a78806db3bf6146e66cf60",
      "source_handle": "P0565",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "planning_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该综述为“肠道微生物组如何调节实体瘤中免疫检查点抑制剂的疗效”这一核心问题提供了关键的背景框架和具体证据汇总。它详细列举了与疗效正负相关的特定微生物类群（如F. prausnitzii, A. muciniphila vs. Candida），阐述了潜在的免疫调节机制（SCFA、DC成熟、T细胞激活），并强调了当前证据的异质性和局限性。这对于构建综述中关于“微生物组作为生物标志物的现状与挑战”以及“机制解释”的部分至关重要。",
      "role": "planner_interpretation",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::08de776306040abe73aecd87d2fabdbd99227dd11a0c0b0866dc9fe657088a28",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::31f74040652c3a10bffa6be1ae51e3b3753dde2c941d62f4e374dfa95a684d6c",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::e8699cb459770e3f2cab29babdc0e0534a64bc5cdd5b73e4e3184d1775ec8ce1",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::d8a2f9c469d95bbd2fcf7e8e": {
      "atom_id": "atom::d8a2f9c469d95bbd2fcf7e8e",
      "source_handle": "P0565",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "这些关联主要基于观察性研究，存在混杂因素。不同队列间结果不一致，不能简单地将某一菌属视为通用生物标志物。",
        "contribution": "提供了具体的微生物特征与ICI疗效关联的证据汇总：产SCFA菌（F. prausnitzii, A. muciniphila）通常与良好反应相关，而真菌失调（Candida, Malassezia）与较差反应相关。同时指出这种关联是异质的，没有单一的一致性签名。",
        "facet_id": "F1"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::08de776306040abe73aecd87d2fabdbd99227dd11a0c0b0866dc9fe657088a28",
          "field_path": [
