    "atom::19e0ec894f1eb5a1184b3d6d": {
      "atom_id": "atom::19e0ec894f1eb5a1184b3d6d",
      "source_handle": "P0545",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "problem_or_question"
      ],
      "value": "在波兰人群中，基线肠道微生物组的组成以及饮食等外在因素是否与黑色素瘤患者对抗PD-1治疗的临床反应（响应 vs. 非响应）相关？是否存在人群特异性的微生物标志物？",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::1bb80f168552ffb9a6448494df1485fd1e32c886ba6c242a17b324b2dd9e89a7",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::f8979429b0413510bd6a75a462efc3524c95b7d8a8eef31dbe5f5d84300106c4",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::35e87c4d82b8d66d81bff14040fe9b594bfacc9bed609adef18f3a0bdddb003f",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::863cf7d94bd87e259d9fdeb2": {
      "atom_id": "atom::863cf7d94bd87e259d9fdeb2",
      "source_handle": "P0545",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "research_scope"
      ],
      "value": "波兰人群中的转移性黑色素瘤患者（接受抗PD-1治疗）及健康对照，聚焦基线肠道微生物组组成、饮食模式与免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）疗效的关联。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::1bb80f168552ffb9a6448494df1485fd1e32c886ba6c242a17b324b2dd9e89a7",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::f8979429b0413510bd6a75a462efc3524c95b7d8a8eef31dbe5f5d84300106c4",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::b3f84fb93cffa760495e9e0dd713a94d18ed280d5a465b55131ce3f029d88477",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::ba74aefc5df7bb8b114ac5d3": {
      "atom_id": "atom::ba74aefc5df7bb8b114ac5d3",
      "source_handle": "P0545",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "work_summary"
      ],
      "value": "本研究旨在探讨波兰裔黑色素瘤患者对抗PD-1治疗的反应与其基线肠道微生物组及外在修饰因素（如饮食）之间的关联。研究招募了64名接受抗PD-1治疗的患者和10名健康对照，通过问卷调查收集人口统计学、生活方式和饮食数据，并在治疗前采集粪便样本进行16S rRNA基因测序（metataxonomics）及部分宏基因组鸟枪法测序。结果显示，响应者（R）与非响应者（NR）在肠道菌群结构上存在显著差异：响应者的拟杆菌门/厚壁菌门（Bacteroidota/Firmicutes）比值较高，物种丰富度较低；响应者肠道中普雷沃氏菌（Prevotella copri）和均匀拟杆菌（Bacteroides uniformis）丰度较高，而非响应者则富集普拉梭菌（Faecalibacterium prausnitzii）、肠脱硫弧菌（Desulfovibrio intestinalis）及部分未分类厚壁菌。此外，高植物摄入和低乳制品摄入与更好的治疗反应相关。该研究强调了肠道微生物组和饮食对ICI疗效的影响具有人群特异性。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::1bb80f168552ffb9a6448494df1485fd1e32c886ba6c242a17b324b2dd9e89a7",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::f8979429b0413510bd6a75a462efc3524c95b7d8a8eef31dbe5f5d84300106c4",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::99d4909afa818918cf47c99c7f9656d68546bb0fc77ee090833a33152c42433f",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::49cb8db198fa13c507057ec7": {
      "atom_id": "atom::49cb8db198fa13c507057ec7",
      "source_handle": "P0545",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "planning_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该论文为综述提供了关于肠道微生物组影响免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）疗效的人群特异性证据。其核心价值在于揭示了在波兰人群中，特定的微生物组合（P. copri, B. uniformis）和饮食模式（高植物、低乳制品）与治疗响应正相关，这与部分其他队列（如Chaput et al.发现Faecalibacterium有益）的结果形成对比，有助于综述讨论“微生物标志物的人群依赖性”和“饮食-微生物-免疫”交互作用。",
      "role": "planner_interpretation",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::1bb80f168552ffb9a6448494df1485fd1e32c886ba6c242a17b324b2dd9e89a7",
