    "atom::649fc62a716f787ebaafdc14": {
      "atom_id": "atom::649fc62a716f787ebaafdc14",
      "source_handle": "P0170",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "approach"
      ],
      "value": "1. **数据整合**：从NCBI SRA下载9个研究的宏基因组数据，筛选仅包含响应者（CR/PR）和非响应者（PD/D）的样本，排除稳定疾病患者，最终纳入569个样本。 2. **预处理与分类**：使用Kraken2和Bracken进行物种水平丰度估计；使用QIIME2进行Alpha/Beta多样性分析。 3. **肠型聚类**：基于Bray-Curtis距离矩阵，使用PAM算法将样本聚类为两个主要肠型（E1, E2）及四个亚群（E1.1, E1.2, E2.1, E2.2）。 4. **标志物识别**：在每个肠型及整体数据集中使用LEfSe分析寻找区分R和NR的差异物种。 5. **独立验证**：在独立的MOC队列（n=19，仅含卓越响应者）中，计算样本所属肠型及差异物种丰度与发现数据集响应者分布的一致性（Bootstrap置信评分）。 6. **机器学习预测**：测试7种机器学习算法（包括集成学习）在物种和属水平上区分R/NR的性能，并在MOC队列中进行外部测试。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::f43e442780a4b5a132af9350ba6631299cdb484f88c84a7f17cea3f912a9657a",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "approach"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::779682c98903d54f3cd4031f5f66a8e792c6f0f7c08cfa5dddbc851c13c65d61",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::745a3818c1688fac61b6880c": {
      "atom_id": "atom::745a3818c1688fac61b6880c",
      "source_handle": "P0170",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "contribution_and_limits"
      ],
      "value": {
        "contribution": "提出了基于肠型分层来识别ICI反应生物标志物的概念验证框架，揭示了不同肠型中响应标志物的异质性（如*Collinsella*在E2，*Bacteroides*在E1）。",
        "limits": "数据集存在严重的肿瘤类型混杂（E2几乎全为MM），导致肠型间的反应率差异无法独立于肿瘤类型进行因果推断。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::f43e442780a4b5a132af9350ba6631299cdb484f88c84a7f17cea3f912a9657a",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "contribution_and_limits",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::a50bfc3967e831ba0a9e2e53efab633bf9ea7b69c49cba01669172bd222b8e1e",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::a4b918bbd77c5e221848540c": {
      "atom_id": "atom::a4b918bbd77c5e221848540c",
      "source_handle": "P0170",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "contribution_and_limits"
      ],
      "value": {
        "contribution": "通过独立队列（MOC）初步验证了部分标志物（如*Blautia A*）在不同人群中的信号一致性。",
        "limits": "MOC队列仅包含卓越响应者，缺乏非响应者对照，无法评估模型的鉴别诊断能力或预测性能，仅能证明信号的存在而非预测效力。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::f43e442780a4b5a132af9350ba6631299cdb484f88c84a7f17cea3f912a9657a",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "contribution_and_limits",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::a50bfc3967e831ba0a9e2e53efab633bf9ea7b69c49cba01669172bd222b8e1e",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::aded47d95b22096755b1e0ca": {
      "atom_id": "atom::aded47d95b22096755b1e0ca",
      "source_handle": "P0170",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "contribution_and_limits"
      ],
      "value": {
        "contribution": "展示了机器学习在捕捉复杂微生物模式方面的潜力，特别是在同质化亚组中。",
        "limits": "整体预测性能中等（AUC/Accuracy ~0.64），且受限于回顾性数据的批次效应和技术异质性，尚不具备直接临床应用价值。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::f43e442780a4b5a132af9350ba6631299cdb484f88c84a7f17cea3f912a9657a",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "contribution_and_limits",
            "2"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::a50bfc3967e831ba0a9e2e53efab633bf9ea7b69c49cba01669172bd222b8e1e",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::107fb50062b26e8a5b2f376c": {
      "atom_id": "atom::107fb50062b26e8a5b2f376c",
      "source_handle": "P0170",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "整体数据集（WD, n=569）",
        "finding": "未发现响应者与未响应者在Alpha多样性上的显著差异；Beta多样性显示两组重叠但存在统计学差异（PERMANOVA p=0.043）。聚类得到E1（主要包含MM和NSCLC）和E2（高度富集MM，无RCC）。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::f43e442780a4b5a132af9350ba6631299cdb484f88c84a7f17cea3f912a9657a",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::24176d37a4d5363c429add66ea21d15ec02ca2f19906cc723a43b8fda5a84859",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::509a6084d5dee8c0fcc31034": {
      "atom_id": "atom::509a6084d5dee8c0fcc31034",
      "source_handle": "P0170",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "肠型特异性分析",
        "finding": "E1主要由拟杆菌科驱动，E2由毛螺菌科、肠杆菌科等驱动。E2.1亚群的反应率显著低于E2.2（31.9% vs 56.7%），但该结果受肿瘤类型分布不均（E2主要为MM）的限制，不能独立解释为肠型效应。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::f43e442780a4b5a132af9350ba6631299cdb484f88c84a7f17cea3f912a9657a",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::24176d37a4d5363c429add66ea21d15ec02ca2f19906cc723a43b8fda5a84859",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::e62e317d484b37ad21497d1f": {
      "atom_id": "atom::e62e317d484b37ad21497d1f",
      "source_handle": "P0170",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "生物标志物识别",
        "finding": "共鉴定出166种肠型特异性响应生物标志物。*Collinsella*属在E2.1中为主要阳性标志物；*Bacteroides*属主要在E1中作为标志物；*Blautia A*属在多个肠型中均显示出稳健的响应关联。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::f43e442780a4b5a132af9350ba6631299cdb484f88c84a7f17cea3f912a9657a",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "2"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::24176d37a4d5363c429add66ea21d15ec02ca2f19906cc723a43b8fda5a84859",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::78a1e59ab17a8cb8aadcc846": {
      "atom_id": "atom::78a1e59ab17a8cb8aadcc846",
      "source_handle": "P0170",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "独立队列一致性评估 (MOC, n=19)",
        "finding": "在仅有卓越响应者的MOC队列中，*Blautia A*、*Collinsella*和部分*Bacteroides*物种显示出与发现数据集中的响应者分布一致的模式。由于缺乏非响应者对照，这仅作为探索性一致性证据，而非预测验证。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::f43e442780a4b5a132af9350ba6631299cdb484f88c84a7f17cea3f912a9657a",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "3"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::24176d37a4d5363c429add66ea21d15ec02ca2f19906cc723a43b8fda5a84859",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::d504a8a67fb308cff8072f71": {
      "atom_id": "atom::d504a8a67fb308cff8072f71",
      "source_handle": "P0170",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "机器学习预测",
        "finding": "在整体测试集上，集成模型最高准确率为0.640。在仅包含完全响应者（CR）的子集或MOC队列中，准确率提升至0.80-0.95，表明模型能捕捉强治疗获益的信号，但在异质性人群中区分能力有限。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::f43e442780a4b5a132af9350ba6631299cdb484f88c84a7f17cea3f912a9657a",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "4"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::24176d37a4d5363c429add66ea21d15ec02ca2f19906cc723a43b8fda5a84859",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::71d454046e82c29ec0415931": {
      "atom_id": "atom::71d454046e82c29ec0415931",
      "source_handle": "P0170",
      "field_path": [
