    "atom::3bd92c24a6b4a8f1f191f1bc": {
      "atom_id": "atom::3bd92c24a6b4a8f1f191f1bc",
      "source_handle": "P0289",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "problem_or_question"
      ],
      "value": "尽管已知肠道微生物组影响癌症发展和ICI疗效，但其在不同癌症类型中的普遍性作用尚不明确，且伴随药物（如PPI）如何通过改变微生物组进而影响ICI疗效的机制缺乏跨癌种的系统性证据。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::dfe0416f25528e22fe6c9a2942ea518e78fea681a3b797ca34340c88fe5d2306",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::273320fd385e1eb5738c37b6ad1ac99c6ca7008237ac2326c5379910e83d0d74",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::291327ed5dfd7914908580bccd50e4cc18bd33b82b28b2f32a0e2c17dad4950b",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::5cb5f7a77e21f90314851c9f": {
      "atom_id": "atom::5cb5f7a77e21f90314851c9f",
      "source_handle": "P0289",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "research_scope"
      ],
      "value": "日本全国范围内晚期实体瘤患者（SCRUM-Japan MONSTAR-SCREEN项目），重点分析化疗未治疗队列（n=817）的微生物组基线特征，以及接受免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）治疗队列（n=333）的疗效关联。涵盖多种癌症类型，特别关注上消化道肿瘤与质子泵抑制剂（PPI）使用的影响。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::dfe0416f25528e22fe6c9a2942ea518e78fea681a3b797ca34340c88fe5d2306",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::273320fd385e1eb5738c37b6ad1ac99c6ca7008237ac2326c5379910e83d0d74",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::bcaaa2277b4ab6301b53c7a285cb02eda0521f46f842714259a88ebe6fa7cc18",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::c83e364771a50ce697eac2c5": {
      "atom_id": "atom::c83e364771a50ce697eac2c5",
      "source_handle": "P0289",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "work_summary"
      ],
      "value": "本研究利用大规模全国性筛查项目的数据，旨在阐明晚期实体瘤患者肠道微生物组的景观及其对ICI疗效的影响。研究首先分析了化疗前患者的微生物组特征，发现上消化道肿瘤（尤其是术后胃癌和胰腺癌）及PPI使用者粪便中口腔细菌比例显著升高。随后，在ICI治疗队列中，研究发现整体α多样性（ASV计数、Shannon指数）与ICI疗效无显著关联，这与部分既往单一癌种研究的结论不同。然而，粪便中高比例的口腔细菌与较短的无进展生存期（PFS）显著相关。进一步分析显示，这种负面影响在同时使用PPI的患者中更为明显，提示PPI诱导的口腔细菌易位可能是降低ICI疗效的重要机制之一。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::dfe0416f25528e22fe6c9a2942ea518e78fea681a3b797ca34340c88fe5d2306",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::273320fd385e1eb5738c37b6ad1ac99c6ca7008237ac2326c5379910e83d0d74",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::f1fb7b623ad1b5e9f0b89d91917749e604f5e3ee2e216e5b9fc9bae3e33bae56",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::b61cfb10c4b30983f1230e8a": {
      "atom_id": "atom::b61cfb10c4b30983f1230e8a",
      "source_handle": "P0289",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "planning_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该论文提供了关于肠道微生物组如何受癌症类型和合并用药（特别是PPI）影响的跨癌种实证数据，并指出了粪便中口腔细菌作为ICI疗效负面预测因子的潜力。对于综述而言，其核心价值在于解构了“微生物组-ICI疗效”关系的复杂性，特别是揭示了常规药物（PPI）通过改变微生物组成分（口腔细菌易位）干扰免疫治疗的具体情境，这有助于解释为何不同研究中微生物组标志物的表现不一致。",
      "role": "planner_interpretation",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::dfe0416f25528e22fe6c9a2942ea518e78fea681a3b797ca34340c88fe5d2306",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::273320fd385e1eb5738c37b6ad1ac99c6ca7008237ac2326c5379910e83d0d74",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::20d9044ad783f9e1f95c901d9b62bb6273c0701afb5d6fc7a55c3007532bcc1a",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::13c12230315ba2f70eab11aa": {
      "atom_id": "atom::13c12230315ba2f70eab11aa",
      "source_handle": "P0289",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "该结果基于观察性队列，且亚组分析统计效力有限；不能直接外推至所有治疗场景（如联合免疫疗法）。",
        "contribution": "提供了跨多种实体瘤类型的微生物组基线数据，显示α多样性（ASV/Shannon）与ICI疗效的整体关联不显著，仅在特定癌种（食管、尿路上皮、肾细胞癌）或特定治疗模式（单药vs联合化疗）下呈现异质性。",
        "facet_id": "F1"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::dfe0416f25528e22fe6c9a2942ea518e78fea681a3b797ca34340c88fe5d2306",
          "field_path": [
