    },
    "atom::62803cf1f35df9d793ad8b7d": {
      "atom_id": "atom::62803cf1f35df9d793ad8b7d",
      "source_handle": "P0364",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "problem_or_question"
      ],
      "value": "针对微生物群-ICI研究中分类学发现缺乏可重复性且结果不一致的问题，探讨这种不一致是否源于底层的功能趋同机制，并梳理该领域的研究演变、转化趋势及当前面临的挑战。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::09453c46fe36046e2b9f48ff6256228cf0dc85f082eb8d8faf50756318235919",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::8a84815329391d1f888cb88fc5dc033770ef1cb3c5ef6130d969b483fa3f7d3a",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::8d47f0eacec093dad5b4cb2a": {
      "atom_id": "atom::8d47f0eacec093dad5b4cb2a",
      "source_handle": "P0364",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "research_scope"
      ],
      "value": "肠道微生物群与免疫检查点抑制剂（ICIs）在实体瘤治疗中的相互作用研究，时间跨度为2013年至2025年。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::09453c46fe36046e2b9f48ff6256228cf0dc85f082eb8d8faf50756318235919",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::2d9085d21b1eab7a020c55bce16b92c92e4ccda649142a498e1d562e478d2c42",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::47c662b783d3427c233a958e": {
      "atom_id": "atom::47c662b783d3427c233a958e",
      "source_handle": "P0364",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "work_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该综述旨在解决肠道微生物群与ICI疗效关联研究中存在的分类学不一致性问题。作者通过整合Web of Science核心合集的文献计量学分析（2,195篇文献）和ClinicalTrials.gov的临床试验数据，结合对代表性临床及临床前研究的定性跨队列功能综合，探讨了微生物-ICI相互作用是否在共享免疫通路层面存在功能趋同。研究发现，尽管不同队列中响应相关的细菌物种差异显著，但功能上均指向短链脂肪酸产生、树突状细胞激活和CD8+ T细胞致敏等免疫调节通路。文章提出，分类学的变异可能反映了功能冗余而非生物学矛盾，并建议向基于功能的生物标志物和干预策略转变。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::09453c46fe36046e2b9f48ff6256228cf0dc85f082eb8d8faf50756318235919",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::b61846ca3b6574fe9ae6dfb76ef50c8414e9d6ceceebc1d72d5663f3224a4b4a",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::4145da794f1c2304e255337a": {
      "atom_id": "atom::4145da794f1c2304e255337a",
      "source_handle": "P0364",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "planning_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该论文为综述提供了关于微生物群-ICI领域从分类学描述向功能机制和临床干预转型的关键背景证据。它特别适用于解释为何不同研究中微生物标志物不一致，并提出“功能趋同”作为整合这些不一致发现的理论框架。此外，它提供了该领域临床试验活动的时间线数据和主要干预策略（如FMT）的现状，有助于评估该领域的成熟度和转化瓶颈。",
      "role": "planner_interpretation",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::09453c46fe36046e2b9f48ff6256228cf0dc85f082eb8d8faf50756318235919",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::621f3e788fd6885a038b18c7eb59e71bf219aa1f96e634bea09bba2ff1837949",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::3e1984b3ca8b725e905ca262": {
      "atom_id": "atom::3e1984b3ca8b725e905ca262",
      "source_handle": "P0364",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "仅基于定性综合，未提供定量效应估计；主要涵盖黑色素瘤、NSCLC等实体瘤，但未详细区分所有亚型的具体差异。",
        "contribution": "提供了微生物群影响ICI疗效的临床证据图谱，指出响应者相关菌群虽物种各异，但均富集于免疫调节共生菌。",
        "facet_id": "F1"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::09453c46fe36046e2b9f48ff6256228cf0dc85f082eb8d8faf50756318235919",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::8cb45ef158813ec5ac261152d5b6055bc1080761a698c998aea2be74196c7ba8",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::59e6017a59cff1c0c7a389e4": {
      "atom_id": "atom::59e6017a59cff1c0c7a389e4",
      "source_handle": "P0364",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions",
        "possible_uses"
      ],
      "value": "用于回答“肠道微生物群如何调节实体瘤中ICI的疗效”，特别是解释不同研究中微生物标志物不一致的现象，支持微生物群作为疗效调节因子的观点。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::09453c46fe36046e2b9f48ff6256228cf0dc85f082eb8d8faf50756318235919",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0",
            "possible_uses"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::7f4a3ac10fbe9b497d768c92d90d8d0de1e027a35d35de7118193bb0b1510071",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::3b7a2ae7cc5b05daaa11d775": {
      "atom_id": "atom::3b7a2ae7cc5b05daaa11d775",
      "source_handle": "P0364",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "机制解释主要基于文献回顾和概念框架，部分机制（如inosine的作用）主要来自临床前模型，其在人体中的确切贡献尚需更多验证；因果关系受限于观察性研究的混杂因素。",
        "contribution": "详细阐述了微生物-ICI相互作用的潜在机制，包括短链脂肪酸产生、树突状细胞成熟、Th1极化和CD8+ T细胞激活等通路。",
        "facet_id": "F2"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::09453c46fe36046e2b9f48ff6256228cf0dc85f082eb8d8faf50756318235919",
