    "atom::708c6dc34b637e9b959cfda5": {
      "atom_id": "atom::708c6dc34b637e9b959cfda5",
      "source_handle": "P0437",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "problem_or_question"
      ],
      "value": "现有的基于参考基因组数据库的分类学丰度方法限制了未表征微生物的发现和功能解释，且缺乏跨队列和癌症类型的高分辨率、可泛化的预测生物标志物。如何构建更有效的预测模型以区分ICI治疗响应者与非响应者？",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::632dbc6fb80b78c563de25fc6054f20c4b3951feab575d7acd899b23a764d03d",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::ffdbd4f56347fe053efb32d562bee8d7ecd39153001d32349038b4bae6dbaa43",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::7d5ad378e6d7f1a02700fe10": {
      "atom_id": "atom::7d5ad378e6d7f1a02700fe10",
      "source_handle": "P0437",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "research_scope"
      ],
      "value": "研究对象为接受免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）治疗的实体瘤患者，涵盖黑色素瘤及多种罕见实体瘤。情境包括不同地理区域、不同治疗策略（联合免疫检查点阻断 CICB 与单药治疗）以及不同年龄层（>60岁与≤60岁）。范围聚焦于利用粪便宏基因组数据预测治疗反应和12个月无进展生存期（PFS）。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::632dbc6fb80b78c563de25fc6054f20c4b3951feab575d7acd899b23a764d03d",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::84e411b620563cba0be16e331fca7b948ecdee76b402c8b0951d4efa1e8758a2",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::74f62456da230e452dce8a66": {
      "atom_id": "atom::74f62456da230e452dce8a66",
      "source_handle": "P0437",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "work_summary"
      ],
      "value": "本研究旨在解决现有ICI疗效预测生物标志物依赖分类学丰度、难以捕捉未表征微生物功能异质性的问题。作者整合了四个公开可用的粪便宏基因组队列（Ashray_2024, Lee_2022, Matson_2018, Frankel_2017），开发了一种名为BioP-VAE的深度学习模型。该模型以基因水平微生物丰度（RPKM特征）为输入，并引入基于蛋白质序列嵌入的生物先验知识。研究比较了基因水平特征与传统分类学特征在预测ICI反应及12个月PFS中的性能，并通过特征归因分析和年龄分层分析揭示了关键微生物基因及其潜在的生物学机制。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::632dbc6fb80b78c563de25fc6054f20c4b3951feab575d7acd899b23a764d03d",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::b460fe757d41251cab60441cbe8b75968375b352c20e8546732af9f6a1daaada",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::9ef3dcd87c98814b0aad0acf": {
      "atom_id": "atom::9ef3dcd87c98814b0aad0acf",
      "source_handle": "P0437",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "planning_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该论文提供了关于肠道微生物组预测ICI疗效的高分辨率证据，重点在于‘基因水平’而非‘物种水平’的特征优势。它直接回应了综述中关于微生物组如何调节ICI疗效的问题，特别是通过提供具体的微生物基因通路（如nitrilase）和特定菌群（如Ruminococcaceae, Desulfovibrionaceae）的贡献证据。此外，其关于治疗策略（CICB vs 单药）和年龄分层对微生物信号影响的发现，为理解效应的情境依赖性提供了重要素材。",
      "role": "planner_interpretation",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::632dbc6fb80b78c563de25fc6054f20c4b3951feab575d7acd899b23a764d03d",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::5820d81886bb69fa0748c6e44f3400a78125d30eaf605207622318b5da96178d",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::65503468d23f0b34c349344a": {
      "atom_id": "atom::65503468d23f0b34c349344a",
      "source_handle": "P0437",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "结果主要基于Ashray_2024（罕见实体瘤+CICB）和黑色素瘤队列。跨队列泛化仅在CICB背景下成立，单药背景下的泛化性差，因此不能推广为通用的单一微生物标志物。",
        "contribution": "提供了基因水平微生物丰度作为预测生物标志物的实证数据，证明其在CICB治疗下优于分类学特征。具体识别出在响应者中富集的Rikenellaceae, Ruminococcaceae, Lachnospiraceae家族，以及在非响应者中富集的Desulfovibrionaceae, Bacteroidaceae家族。",
        "facet_id": "F1"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::632dbc6fb80b78c563de25fc6054f20c4b3951feab575d7acd899b23a764d03d",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::1051062cc584794ab5de769ddc75f9db8a925c7a6853e87b76e9f28972a64095",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::0cd7b9aa4be2bcee3d97ff6a": {
      "atom_id": "atom::0cd7b9aa4be2bcee3d97ff6a",
      "source_handle": "P0437",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions",
        "possible_uses"
      ],
      "value": "可用于支持‘特定微生物类群与ICI疗效正/负相关’的论点，特别是强调功能基因层面比分类学层面更具预测力。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::632dbc6fb80b78c563de25fc6054f20c4b3951feab575d7acd899b23a764d03d",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0",
            "possible_uses"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::026be3fe1e418f7b3fe568b966956f306bcbdb11650ce4ceb3903310dc8b32ab",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::aa57ec061e37cb85469a506b": {
      "atom_id": "atom::aa57ec061e37cb85469a506b",
      "source_handle": "P0437",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "这些是相关性分析（特征归因后的富集），并非因果实验验证。机制解释依赖于作者的理论推导，需注明为假设性关联。",
        "contribution": "通过KEGG和GO富集分析揭示了潜在机制：响应者中富集的nitrilase基因参与氮代谢和T细胞调节；非响应者中富集的lipoic acid metabolism可能通过调节氧化应激影响免疫。年龄分层显示老年响应者与Bifidobacterium相关，年轻响应者与UBA11524等相关。",
        "facet_id": "F2"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::632dbc6fb80b78c563de25fc6054f20c4b3951feab575d7acd899b23a764d03d",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::1051062cc584794ab5de769ddc75f9db8a925c7a6853e87b76e9f28972a64095",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::e15f704e7f8e0690febfc7c5": {
      "atom_id": "atom::e15f704e7f8e0690febfc7c5",
      "source_handle": "P0437",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions",
        "possible_uses"
      ],
      "value": "用于解释微生物组调节ICI疗效的潜在生化机制（如氮代谢、氧化应激）以及宿主年龄对微生物-免疫互作的影响。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
