    "atom::bf94a46ec6e4c6624f1edcd9": {
      "atom_id": "atom::bf94a46ec6e4c6624f1edcd9",
      "source_handle": "P0511",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "approach"
      ],
      "value": "1. 数据筛选：从PubMed检索并纳入4项包含人类MM患者基线粪便MGS数据的公开研究，排除肾细胞癌和非小细胞肺癌数据以确保一致性。2. 统一重处理：使用自定义生物信息学流程（mOTUs2进行物种丰度定量，HUMAnN2进行功能通路定量）对所有原始数据进行标准化重分析。3. 统计比较：采用Wilcoxon秩和检验（未校正多重比较）识别差异丰度物种和MetaCyc通路；使用加权UniFrac距离进行Beta多样性分析；构建共现网络分析微生物互作。4. 机器学习验证：利用差异特征训练随机森林（RF）分类器，并在独立的Peters队列中进行外部验证，评估分类性能（AUC）及预后价值（Kaplan-Meier生存分析与Log-rank检验）。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::876d049940377080941b53c18d98c0ee0c4938538398907d0622b468858c87d2",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "approach"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::da02714da4a9778f4f2edc5a4684097748c12a37b858e997bece7471e5159010",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::71f227e6b60ee717c0436358": {
      "atom_id": "atom::71f227e6b60ee717c0436358",
      "source_handle": "P0511",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "contribution_and_limits"
      ],
      "value": {
        "contribution": "通过荟萃分析整合多中心数据，识别出跨队列一致的微生物签名（如Faecalibacterium和B. intestinihominis）及功能特征（维生素B代谢），为ICI疗效的生物标志物提供了综合证据。",
        "limits": "差异丰度分析未进行多重检验校正，可能存在假阳性；模型在独立队列中的预测性能有限（AUC~0.62），且预后关联未达到统计显著性；未能阐明具体的因果机制，仅提出假设。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::876d049940377080941b53c18d98c0ee0c4938538398907d0622b468858c87d2",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "contribution_and_limits",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::457533e48b8bb3350a8d68f58b2df67d35c3334bfe5157270dc439f3666717cb",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::7c28e449234e1015730954e3": {
      "atom_id": "atom::7c28e449234e1015730954e3",
      "source_handle": "P0511",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "pooled MM patients (N=130), unadjusted Wilcoxon test",
        "finding": "响应者（R）中富集的物种包括Faecalibacterium属、Ruminococcaceae科未知种、Barnesiella intestinihominis和Ruminococcus bicirculans；非响应者（NR）中富集Bacteroides thetaiotaomicron、Adlercreutzia equolifaciens等。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::876d049940377080941b53c18d98c0ee0c4938538398907d0622b468858c87d2",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
