      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::8f3b9cce31ad8f3df0f57141": {
      "atom_id": "atom::8f3b9cce31ad8f3df0f57141",
      "source_handle": "P0015",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "problem_or_question"
      ],
      "value": "既往基于物种水平的肠道微生物标志物在预测ICB疗效时缺乏跨队列的可重复性；同时，不同ICB方案（如联合治疗vs单药）是否共享相同的微生物预测机制尚不明确。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::69b4d0d71a34e929f405655da8bc53219cc0d44dce89b09788cbd51e2649de5f",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::81db5e239ec44f03b6b10407a5d47a73d303b6af4391f2032c4303b0c56317c8",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::607964d05fbf7bf1354cfc31": {
      "atom_id": "atom::607964d05fbf7bf1354cfc31",
      "source_handle": "P0015",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "research_scope"
      ],
      "value": "针对接受联合免疫检查点阻断（CICB，即抗PD-1加抗CTLA-4）治疗的多种罕见实体瘤患者，以及外部验证队列中的黑色素瘤患者，研究基线肠道微生物组对治疗反应的预测价值。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::69b4d0d71a34e929f405655da8bc53219cc0d44dce89b09788cbd51e2649de5f",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::0f0fca9a6715aabdee37ae1fecf5028c3c169222bafa449cb1728c40f89942ce",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::169f8ac17a88e8e8a676aa35": {
      "atom_id": "atom::169f8ac17a88e8e8a676aa35",
      "source_handle": "P0015",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "work_summary"
      ],
      "value": "本研究旨在解决既往基于物种水平的微生物标志物在跨队列中可重复性差的问题，提出菌株水平分辨率可能更精准地捕捉与免疫检查点阻断（ICB）反应相关的微生物特征。作者利用CA209-538临床试验的106名罕见实体瘤患者的基线粪便样本进行深度鸟枪法宏基因组测序，构建了一个包含1,397个菌株基因组的自定义参考数据库。通过监督机器学习模型，发现菌株水平的微生物丰度比物种水平或临床因素更能预测CICB的治疗反应和12个月无进展生存期。进一步通过对六个外部独立研究的荟萃分析，证实了该菌株响应签名在不同癌症类型和国家间具有泛癌种有效性，但其预测能力严格依赖于训练集和测试集使用相同的ICB治疗方案（CICB或抗PD-1单药），表明微生物-宿主关系具有治疗方案的特异性而非肿瘤类型的特异性。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::69b4d0d71a34e929f405655da8bc53219cc0d44dce89b09788cbd51e2649de5f",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::a4fd1bc24fb803ee412c2b4668cf3c322ae6873b69f51f8883688595f656083d",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::fdeff01ec6ab409d468649c0": {
      "atom_id": "atom::fdeff01ec6ab409d468649c0",
      "source_handle": "P0015",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "planning_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该论文为综述提供了关于肠道微生物组预测ICB疗效的关键方法论启示和分层策略素材。它证明了单纯依赖物种水平分类会导致信息丢失，强调了菌株分辨率的重要性；同时，它有力地支持了将ICB疗效按治疗方案（CICB vs 单药）进行细分分析的必要性，反驳了单一通用微生物标志物的假设。",
      "role": "planner_interpretation",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::69b4d0d71a34e929f405655da8bc53219cc0d44dce89b09788cbd51e2649de5f",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::4909f3e215360bc38c36101768d5a52cfb790a46f0f846cad2ec17f0384ca341",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::36a7de06ce88d178887cb4ed": {
      "atom_id": "atom::36a7de06ce88d178887cb4ed",
      "source_handle": "P0015",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "该结论主要基于罕见实体瘤的CICB治疗数据，外推至其他癌症类型或单药治疗时需保持谨慎。",
        "contribution": "提供了具体的实证数据，证明在CICB治疗背景下，菌株水平的微生物特征能显著提升预测准确率（AUC从物种级的较低值提升至0.73），且该签名跨越不同罕见癌症类型有效。",
        "facet_id": "F1"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::69b4d0d71a34e929f405655da8bc53219cc0d44dce89b09788cbd51e2649de5f",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::e134b6490d41486be465b57e38b00e3eeb3d12a8cc979c2484ff6b06a57bbf5d",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::0a8cce0fc38c929e40b49aea": {
      "atom_id": "atom::0a8cce0fc38c929e40b49aea",
      "source_handle": "P0015",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions",
        "possible_uses"
      ],
      "value": "用于论证在综述中应强调高分辨率微生物分析的价值，以及解释为何某些跨癌种的微生物信号可能存在但被低分辨率分析所掩盖。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::69b4d0d71a34e929f405655da8bc53219cc0d44dce89b09788cbd51e2649de5f",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0",
            "possible_uses"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::fdb002cfa89535a4d8d378a51f7b813b991d2e4a0592b0d13cd2c91228c4f432",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::2b2c749ca49f2ae8573b2656": {
      "atom_id": "atom::2b2c749ca49f2ae8573b2656",
      "source_handle": "P0015",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "这一发现限制了跨治疗方案直接比较微生物标志物的可行性，提示在综合不同研究结果时必须考虑治疗方案的匹配性。",
        "contribution": "揭示了微生物预测签名的‘治疗方案特异性’：针对CICB训练的模型无法预测抗PD-1单药的反应，反之亦然（尽管文中主要展示了CICB模型在单药上的失败）。",
        "facet_id": "F1"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::69b4d0d71a34e929f405655da8bc53219cc0d44dce89b09788cbd51e2649de5f",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::e134b6490d41486be465b57e38b00e3eeb3d12a8cc979c2484ff6b06a57bbf5d",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::c7398cccb3b2b84e32bee99f": {
      "atom_id": "atom::c7398cccb3b2b84e32bee99f",
      "source_handle": "P0015",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions",
        "possible_uses"
      ],
      "value": "用于支持综述中关于‘需根据具体免疫治疗 regimen 定制微生物生物标志物’的观点，避免笼统地讨论‘ICB与微生物的关系’。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::69b4d0d71a34e929f405655da8bc53219cc0d44dce89b09788cbd51e2649de5f",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "1",
            "possible_uses"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::fdb002cfa89535a4d8d378a51f7b813b991d2e4a0592b0d13cd2c91228c4f432",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::cd80817558097eae7d9663d5": {
      "atom_id": "atom::cd80817558097eae7d9663d5",
      "source_handle": "P0015",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "这仅是基于基因组潜力的相关性观察，未提供直接的因果机制证据（如代谢物测量或动物模型验证），不能单独作为机制确定的依据。",
        "contribution": "通过功能注释发现，与CICB反应正相关的菌株（如特定Faecalibacterium菌株）富含完整的丁酸合成基因簇，而负相关菌株则缺失，提出了丁酸代谢作为潜在机制线索。",
        "facet_id": "F2"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::69b4d0d71a34e929f405655da8bc53219cc0d44dce89b09788cbd51e2649de5f",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "2"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::e134b6490d41486be465b57e38b00e3eeb3d12a8cc979c2484ff6b06a57bbf5d",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::9bff1a5c4a0acc1adc778bed": {
      "atom_id": "atom::9bff1a5c4a0acc1adc778bed",
      "source_handle": "P0015",
      "field_path": [
